course: dictionary
lesson: 5212
title: Jaunt: a short trip for fun
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: A jaunt is a short trip taken for fun. Context clues help you spot it: the trip is short, and the reason for going is pleasure. «A jaunt to the seaside» tells you the family went somewhere nice for a day, not on a long, hard journey.
explain: Jaunt can also be a verb, a word for doing the action: to go on such a trip. «They jaunted off down the lane» means they set off happily on a short outing. The noun is a jaunt, jaunts; the verb is jaunt, jaunted, jaunting.
explain: Test your meaning by swapping it in. If «a short trip for fun» fits where jaunt is and the sentence still makes sense, you have the right meaning. Toad in The Wind in the Willows loves jaunts, so the word often sounds cheerful.
fact: A jaunt is a short trip or outing taken for fun.
fact: As a verb, to jaunt means to go on such a trip.
fact: «A jaunt on the river» is a short, happy boat trip, not a long journey.
fact: Toad in The Wind in the Willows loves jaunts, first in a gypsy caravan along the open road, then in motor cars.
fact: Jaunt is a light, happy word. A hard or long journey is not a jaunt.
exercise: Ellie says, «We are going on a jaunt to the seaside.» What is a jaunt? | A type of boat | A long, hard journey across the mountains | *A short trip for fun | A school lesson
exercise: Which verb means to go on a short trip for fun? | *Jaunt | Scramble | Sink | Spin
exercise: Find and copy the word that means a short trip for fun: «We set off on a jaunt before lunch.» | *jaunt | lunch | set | before
test: Toad grinned and said, «Let's go on a jaunt!» What does jaunt mean? | A hard, long march | *A short trip for fun | A type of horse | A quiet nap
test: In «They jaunted into town on Saturday», what does jaunted mean? | Cooked a meal | Hid from everyone | Ran out of money | *Went on a short trip for fun
exam: Which best describes a jaunt? | *A short trip or outing for fun | A hard journey through the snow | A long, tiring walk up a mountain | A dull lesson at school
